// ============================================================
// Warehouse: the personas canvas - the thinking around the personas who work here.
//
// Goals live on the personas themselves (Shared/access.play); what sits around them is on sticky notes: the context they work in,
// what gets in their way, what success looks like and what is still open. Authoring metadata only: it never reaches the running application.
// The personas are laid out by the canvas in a grid, so the notes sit below them: blue for context, pink for pain, green for success, yellow for questions.
// ============================================================

sticky note on personas
  description "Context: on the floor with a handheld scanner and one hand free. Screens must be readable at arm's length."
  colour blue
  position 110 490
  size 250 150

sticky note on personas
  description "Pain point: picking cards arrive in the order they were placed, not in shelf order."
  colour pink
  position 380 490
  size 250 150

sticky note on personas
  description "Success: every paid order is dispatched the day it is paid."
  colour green
  position 650 490
  size 250 150

sticky note on personas
  description "Question: who handles a delivery that does not match its purchase order?"
  position 920 490
  size 250 150
